         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### We are human, but different\n\nNo two people are exactly alike. Not even twin brothers are completely the same.\n\nTo grow our knowledge, we need to understand who we are and how we learn.\n\nIn this lesson, we will get to know ourselves better.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "936de977-cb36-44b2-acba-de5ca9358d75",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "936de977-cb36-44b2-acba-de5ca9358d75",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "81e9393b-d5b6-4b04-91bd-417e943d3e97",
               "text": "Original text",
               "page": "index.html?page=class_content&arg=2a2cbd69-7f09-4a58-aff1-6fbff8c5bda5",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2025",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Comparisons\n\nSometimes we simplify things to make them easier. But this can lead us to mistakes.\n\nAn example is the way we understand **intelligence**.\n\nSome people say that one person is more intelligent than another. We need to think about this.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "b47c31bc-4b61-468d-a7e3-8797a55abe30",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "b47c31bc-4b61-468d-a7e3-8797a55abe30",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "Is there only one type of intelligence?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "4a63236c-8398-4263-82a5-0f5b706eae91",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "No",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "4a63236c-8398-4263-82a5-0f5b706eae91",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "2696b05e-fabc-4818-909a-8fc833c3cd19",
