            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "81e9393b-d5b6-4b04-91bd-417e943d3e97",
               "text": "Original text",
               "page": "index.html?page=class_content&arg=2a2cbd69-7f09-4a58-aff1-6fbff8c5bda5",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2025",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Expanding the horizon\n\nFor a long time, people did not understand **intelligence** well. Because of that, we believed there was only one type of intelligence.\n\nThis caused unfair comparisons. It also kept us from making tools that help everyone learn.\n\nBut research by scientists like Howard Gardner showed us that there are different types of intelligence.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "6a7a33e6-3835-4390-92ff-7699f991fd76",
         "prev": "",
