         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Understanding the chart\n\nOur different types of intelligence change how we learn best. Some people learn better by reading. Others learn better by drawing. Others learn better by dancing.\n\nSome people need help from someone close by. Others can learn on their own.\n\nBecause of this, this app made a decision...",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown or html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
