         "smile": "",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Decision\n\nFrom the next lesson on, we will study how humans discovered the knowledge we have today. To do that, we will create different tools. These tools will help people with different types of intelligence understand how we grew in life and in knowledge.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
